#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/polly.rst:2
msgid "Polly"
msgstr "Polly"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/polly.rst:4
msgid ""
"Polly was a robot created at the MIT Artificial Intelligence Laboratory by "
"Ian Horswill for his Ph.D. published in 1993. It was the first mobile robot "
"to move at animal-like speeds (1m per second) using computer vision for its "
"navigation. It was an example of behavior based robotics. Horswill's PhD "
"supervisors were Rodney Brooks and Lynn Andrea Stein. For a few years, Polly"
" was able to give tours of the AI laboratory's seventh floor, using canned "
"speech to point out landmarks such as Anita Flynn's office. The Polly "
"algorithm is a way to navigate in a cluttered space using very low "
"resolution vision to find uncluttered areas to move forward into, assuming "
"that the pixels at the bottom of the frame (the closest to the robot) show "
"an example of an uncluttered area. Since this could be done 60 times a "
"second, the algorithm only needed to discriminate three categories: telling "
"the robot at each instant to go straight, towards the right or towards the "
"left... (From Wikipedia Article)"
msgstr ""
"Polly je bio robot stvoren u MIT Artificial Intelligence Laboratory od "
"strane Iana Horswilla za njegov doktorat objavljen 1993. Bio je to prvi "
"mobilni robot koji se kretao brzinama sličnim životinjskim (1 m u sekundi) "
"koristeći računalni vid za svoju navigaciju. Bio je primjer robotike "
"temeljene na ponašanju. Horswillovi doktorski mentori bili su Rodney Brooks "
"i Lynn Andrea Stein. Nekoliko godina Polly je mogao provoditi obilaske "
"sedmog kata AI laboratorija, koristeći unaprijed snimljeni govor za "
"isticanje orijentira poput ureda Anite Flynn. Polly algoritam je način "
"navigacije u zakrčenom prostoru koristeći vid vrlo niske razlučivosti za "
"pronalaženje nezakrčenih područja za kretanje naprijed, pod pretpostavkom da"
" pikseli na dnu okvira (najbliži robotu) prikazuju primjer nezakrčenog "
"područja. Budući da se to moglo činiti 60 puta u sekundi, algoritam je "
"trebao razlikovati samo tri kategorije: govoreći robotu u svakom trenutku da"
" ide ravno, prema desno ili prema lijevo... (Iz članka na Wikipediji)"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/polly.rst:18
msgid ""
"For more information, check out Ian's paper `Analysis of Adaptation and "
"Environment <http://www.cs.northwestern.edu/~ian/aij.pdf>`__"
msgstr ""
"Za više informacija pogledajte Ianov rad `Analysis of Adaptation and "
"Environment <http://www.cs.northwestern.edu/~ian/aij.pdf>`__"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/polly.rst:21
msgid ""
"On the CMUcam3, Polly returns histograms that you can use for simple "
"navigation."
msgstr ""
"Na CMUcam3, Polly vraća histograme koje možete koristiti za jednostavnu "
"navigaciju."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/polly.rst:23
msgid ""
"Sample images of the polly algorithm running on the CMUcam3 "
"(``polly_sample.jpg``) were not preserved in the archive. The left column "
"was the original image, the middle column was the filtered and edge detected"
" image, and the final column showed the histogram. The algorithm is under "
"the assumption that the area in front of the camera's view is mostly the "
"same texture. This can be used for simple visual based obstacle avoidance or"
" even navigation. Try making a robot that drives towards the largest peaks "
"in the histogram."
msgstr ""
"Uzorci slika polly algoritma pokrenutog na CMUcam3 (``polly_sample.jpg``) "
"nisu sačuvani u arhivi. Lijevi stupac bila je izvorna slika, srednji stupac "
"bila je filtrirana slika s otkrivenim rubovima, a konačni stupac prikazivao "
"je histogram. Algoritam se temelji na pretpostavci da je područje ispred "
"vidnog polja kamere uglavnom iste teksture. Ovo se može koristiti za "
"jednostavno vizualno izbjegavanje prepreka ili čak navigaciju. Pokušajte "
"napraviti robota koji vozi prema najvećim vrhovima u histogramu."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/polly.rst:31
msgid ""
"The default CC3 polly project takes an image and returns a polly histogram "
"in ASCII text. This can be viewed in a terminal set to 115200 baud, 8N1 with"
" no flow control or hardware handshaking. To visualize the data try using "
"the polly-cc2-gui project described below."
msgstr ""
"Zadani CC3 polly projekt uzima sliku i vraća polly histogram u ASCII tekstu."
" Ovo se može pregledati u terminalu postavljenom na 115200 bauda, 8N1 bez "
"kontrole toka ili hardverskog rukovanja. Za vizualizaciju podataka pokušajte"
" koristiti polly-cc2-gui projekt opisan u nastavku."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/polly.rst:36
msgid "**Visualizing Polly with the CMUcam2 GUI**"
msgstr "**Vizualizacija Pollyja pomoću CMUcam2 GUI-ja**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/polly.rst:38
msgid ""
"The following zip file contains a version of polly that works with the "
"CMUcam2 GUI. This implements the few commands required for the GUI to detect"
" the camera and allow you to call the get histogram command. Only Get "
"Histogram is implemented, so other CMUcam2 functions will not work "
"correctly. To visualize polly, start up the CMUcam2 GUI and then go to the "
"histogram tab and press \"Get Histogram\"."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeća zip datoteka sadrži verziju polly koja radi s CMUcam2 GUI. Ovo "
"implementira nekoliko naredbi potrebnih da GUI otkrije kameru i omogući vam "
"pozivanje naredbe get histogram. Implementirana je samo Get Histogram, tako "
"da druge CMUcam2 funkcije neće ispravno raditi. Za vizualizaciju polly, "
"pokrenite CMUcam2 GUI, a zatim idite na karticu histogram i pritisnite \"Get"
" Histogram\"."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/polly.rst:45
msgid ""
"The ``polly-cc2-gui.zip`` firmware image (CMUcam2 GUI Compatible Polly) that"
" could test polly inside the CMUcam2 GUI was not preserved in the archive."
msgstr ""
"Firmware slika ``polly-cc2-gui.zip`` (Polly kompatibilan s CMUcam2 GUI) koja"
" je mogla testirati polly unutar CMUcam2 GUI nije sačuvana u arhivi."
